<h1>5. System Architecture & Engineering Design</h1>

<h2>5.1 Multi-Tier Architecture</h2>
<p>SafePath AI is organized across four distinct architectural tiers:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Client Tier (React Native / Expo SDK 52):</strong> File-based Expo Router, LeafletMap WebView bridge, Expo SecureStore, and Axios with dynamic server settings modal.</li>
  <li><strong>Application Tier (Spring Boot 3.3 Monolith):</strong> JwtAuthenticationFilter, AStarRoutingEngine, RouteComparisonService, ReportRateLimiterService, OpenMeteoClient, and Hibernate Spatial.</li>
  <li><strong>Data Tier (PostgreSQL 15 + PostGIS):</strong> 17 versioned Flyway migrations, GIST spatial indices on LineString and Point geometries, and immutable audit logs.</li>
  <li><strong>Machine Learning Tier (FastAPI Microservice):</strong> XGBoost v1.0.0 Classifier, Random Forest baseline, TreeSHAP explainer, preprocessor with documented imputation defaults, and Pydantic v2 schemas.</li>
</ul>

